sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Patient
  participant Site_bookings
  participant Web3Forms
  participant Zoho_info
  participant D1
  participant Resend

  Patient->>Site_bookings: Submit booking + Turnstile
  Site_bookings->>Web3Forms: Send booking fields
  Web3Forms->>Zoho_info: To info@
  Web3Forms-->>Site_bookings: Success
  Site_bookings->>D1: Save pending request if overlay on
  Note over D1: Persist is fire-and-forget. Failure does not block clinic email
  Site_bookings->>Resend: Thank-you HTML From info@
  Resend->>Patient: Email = request received
  Site_bookings->>Patient: Show /bookings/thank-you/
